    REFACTOR-0001: add the Drink interface
    
    The cart asks two things of every order item: how should it appear on
    the receipt, and what does it cost. A Latte answers from the menu, and
    a Latte with an extra shot answers by asking the Latte and then adding
    to the answer.
    
    Drink is those two questions. A plain menu drink and a drink with any
    number of add-ons can both be one.
    
    Nothing uses it yet.

